  ['Where do buyers see the number?','On your storefront, on every product listing, in quotes you send and in search results.'],
  ['What happens if I miss a call?','BUBU sends an SMS and an app alert with the buyer details, and the call appears in the lead manager so you can call back through the same line.'],
  ['Whose number shows on my caller ID?','You see 0800 218 400, not the buyer number, so save it in your contacts as BUBU Buyer.'],
  ['Can I print it on my stationery?','Yes. The number stays with your account for as long as your listing is active.'],
  ['Are calls recorded?','Yes, for dispute resolution. Recordings are kept for 90 days under the Data Protection and Privacy Act, 2019.']
